{"id":19665,"date":"2024-07-30T08:07:46","date_gmt":"2024-07-30T08:07:46","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=19665"},"modified":"2024-07-30T08:07:46","modified_gmt":"2024-07-30T08:07:46","slug":"schirmer-strips","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/product\/schirmer-strips\/","title":{"rendered":"Schirmer Strips"},"content":{"rendered":"<h3>Specification Table for Schirmer Strips<\/h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Specification<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Indications<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Measurement of tear production<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Scale<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Printed millimeter (mm) scale for easy reading<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Packaging<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Sterile strips in individual pouches<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Packing Design<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Peel-open packing with transparent film on one side<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Sterility<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Maintained through individual sterile pouches<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Usage<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Diagnostic tool for dry eye syndrome and related conditions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Material<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>High-quality absorbent paper<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Length of Strips<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Standard length for consistent measurements<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>User Convenience<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Easy to handle and read due to clear scale and innovative packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Patient Comfort<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Designed for minimal discomfort during use<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Schirmer Strips are specialized diagnostic tools used to measure tear production in the eyes. These sterile strips, individually packed for convenience and hygiene, feature a printed millimeter scale for easy and accurate reading. The innovative peel-open packaging with a transparent film on one side allows for effortless handling and ensures sterility until use. Schirmer Strips are essential for diagnosing conditions related to tear production, such as dry eye syndrome.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":19666,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":[],"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[86],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-19665","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-fluorescein-schirmer-strips-iris-retractor","first","instock","shipping-taxable","product-type-simple"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product\/19665","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/product"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=19665"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product\/19665\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":19667,"href":"https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product\/19665\/revisions\/19667"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/19666"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=19665"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"product_brand","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product_brand?post=19665"},{"taxonomy":"product_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product_cat?post=19665"},{"taxonomy":"product_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product_tag?post=19665"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}